{"componentChunkName":"component---src-components-concept-jsx","path":"/convencion-codigo/direccion-de-buzamiento.html","result":{"pageContext":{"node":{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/convencion-codigo/direccion-de-buzamiento","type":"Concept","prefLabel":{"es":"dirección de buzamiento","en":"dip dip direction"},"altLabel":null,"hiddenLabel":null,"definition":{"es":"La medida de orientación consiste en un buzamiento y una dirección de buzamiento. El buzamiento es el ángulo que la superficie estructural forma con la horizontal medido perpendicularmente al rumbo y en el plano vertical. La dirección de buzamiento es el acimut perpendicular al rumbo de la estructura.","en":"The orientation measurement consists of a dip and a dip direction. Dip is the angle that the structural surface (eg bedding, fault plane) makes with the horizontal measured perpendicular to the strike of the structure and in the vertical plane Dip direction is the azimuth perpindicular to the strike of the structure"},"note":null,"changeNote":null,"editorialNote":null,"historyNote":null,"scopeNote":null,"notation":null,"example":null,"narrower":[],"narrowerTransitive":[],"broader":null,"broaderTransitive":null,"related":[],"relatedMatch":null,"broadMatch":null,"narrowMatch":null,"closeMatch":null,"exactMatch":[{"id":"http://resource.geosciml.org/classifier/cgi/conventioncode/dip_dip_direction"}],"inScheme":[{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/convencion-codigo","title":null}],"inSchemeAll":[{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/convencion-codigo"}],"topConceptOf":[{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/convencion-codigo","title":null}],"deprecated":null,"isReplacedBy":null},"collections":[{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/convencion-codigo/collection","type":"Collection","prefLabel":{"es":"Código de convención - Todos los conceptos","en":null},"member":[{"id":"https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/convencion-codigo/direccion-de-buzamient